# Files that must NOT enter the runtime fingerprint.
#
# The fingerprint decides which OTA updates a build may receive. It should
# change only when the NATIVE binary meaningfully changes. eas.json is build
# orchestration — channels, submit ids, profiles — none of which alters the
# compiled app, yet on 2026-08-08 a two-line ascAppId addition re-fingerprinted
# the project and orphaned a freshly built binary (build 12, 8a2b6845…) before
# it even reached TestFlight.
eas.json

# Same reasoning as eas.json above: .easignore shapes what UPLOADS to the
# build worker, not what compiles into the binary.
.easignore
